litellm-tde-applet (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release
  * TDE panel applet for LiteLLM proxy control
  * Native kicker integration with status icons
  * Systemd user service for background LiteLLM proxy
  * Free-tier API support (Gemini, NVIDIA Nemotron, Groq, OpenRouter)

